Next steps:
  1. php flo migrate                              (settings, preferences, media, trash, activity, roles, import, password reset, mailing and pages tables, users.bio)
  2. php flo make:admin-resource Post --migration
  3. php flo make:admin-settings                  (website settings pages, optional)
  4. Log in, then open /admin/dashboard

On skeleton 1.8+, /admin opens the dashboard by itself. On older skeletons, link it
from views/pages/admin_index.html:
  <a href="{{ SITE_URI . '/' . ACTIVE_LANG . '/admin/dashboard' }}">Admin panel</a>

Check the setup at any time with: php flo admin:doctor
